    "text": "I had very bad stomach ache and digestive problems, the food is meh taste wise,  just ok, the service is horrible: we had to wait a long time for simple mango lassies and our order was mixed up and some items forgotten despite the restaurant being nearly empty. The table in front of a booth is so narrowly placed so you need to squeeze yourself into the booth. All in all not worth your time or money. The high ratings are probably made by people who'd never tasted Indian food."
